{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi66PQcAhgfgEVZLVw9F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The engine's `addPlayer` calls the join hook, so the couch join can be tested headlessly. Next I'll implement the four items in one batch: a camera director that picks framing and view per phase and event, mouse steering for the runner and defenders, cutscenes with portraits before and after each cup chapter, and more custom animation. The victory dance alternates two poses, and the ball alternates two sprite frames as it rolls."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":623,"cache_read_input_tokens":397910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":623},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91d88268-7ace-4e56-bce5-4455bcc4424c","uuid":"6dbe0c0e-60ba-498a-bb8d-de01ee0a93a2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:01:21.731Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi66P3nBtj4JD7oHPjVQ"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi66PQcAhgfgEVZLVw9F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017c6V8MYKc2VavU4oPYADkU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -n \"setView(\\|setZoom(\" vendor/my-3d2dge.js | head -4 | cut -c1-160 && python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(p,pairs):\n    s=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\n    for o,n in pairs:\n        c=s.count(o); assert c==1,(p,c,o[:90]); s=s.replace(o,n)\n    open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\n\n# 1. mouse steering for the human's player (the runner, or the defender), the lateral only from the keyboard or pad\nedit('src/30-sim.js',[\n (\"      if (I.pressed('pass') && off && h && S.passer !== h) { I.consume('pass'); S.lateral(h); }\",\n  \"      if (I.pressed('pass') && off && h && S.passer !== h && I.lastDevice !== 'mouse') { I.consume('pass'); S.lateral(h); }\"),\n (\"      const mv = I.move(); mx = mv[0]; my = mv[1];\",\n  \"      let mv = I.move();\\n      // the mouse steers: the player runs toward the point the pointer is on the field (when it is clear of the player)\\n      if (I.lastDevice === 'mouse' && FF.game.mouseGround) { const at = FF.game.mouseGround(); if (at && Math.hypot(at[0] - q.x, at[1] - q.y) > 10) { const m = Math.hypot(at[0] - q.x, at[1] - q.y); mv = [(at[0] - q.x) / m, (at[1] - q.y) / m]; } }\\n      mx = mv[0]; my = mv[1];\"),\n])\n\n// 2. the victory dance: the scoring side alternates two poses (a new animation, built from the engine's poses)\nedit('src/30-sim.js',[\n (\"  const sp = Math.hypot(q.vx, q.vy), cheer = S.phase === 'score' && q.side === S.tdSide;\\n  q.rig.update(dt, { x: q.x, y: q.y, z: 0, vx: q.vx, vy: q.vy, facing: q.f, run: clamp(sp / 110, 0, 1), down: q.down > 0 ? 1 : 0, pose: cheer && q.down <= 0 ? 'cheer' : null, expr: q.down > 0 ? 'wince' : cheer ? 'shout' : null });\",\n  \"  const sp = Math.hypot(q.vx, q.vy), cheer = S.phase === 'score' && q.side === S.tdSide;\\n  // the dance: the scorers alternate the cheer and the hips pose on the beat\\n  const beat = Math.floor(S.time * 2.2 + q.slot) % 2 ? 'hips' : 'cheer';\\n  q.rig.update(dt, { x: q.x, y: q.y, z: 0, vx: q.vx, vy: q.vy, facing: q.f, run: clamp(sp / 110, 0, 1), down: q.down > 0 ? 1 : 0, pose: cheer && q.down <= 0 ? beat : null, expr: q.down > 0 ? 'wince' : cheer ? 'shout' : null });\"),\n])\n\n// 3. the camera director: framing from the phase and the play (the wide kick view from overhead, the close carrier, the call's middle of the field)\nedit('src/40-view.js',[\n (\"V.focus = () => {\\n  const b = S.ball, h = b && b.holder;\\n  const tx = h ? h.x : b ? b.x : D.FYM, ty = h ? h.y : b ? b.y : D.FYM;\\n  FF.game.focus(tx, D.FYM + (ty - D.FYM) * .55, 16);   // (the camera eases to it: cam.smooth)\\n};\",\n  \"// the camera director: each moment has its shot. The call: the middle of the field; the snap and the run: the carrier, close;\\n// a kick: from overhead, wide; the whistle and the score: the spot, wide. A replay has its own three angles (35-extras).\\nV.shot = 'call';\\nV.focus = () => {\\n  const b = S.ball, h = b && b.holder, g = FF.game;\\n  const shot = S.phase === 'kick' ? 'kick' : S.phase === 'call' ? 'call' : (S.phase === 'live' && h && S.yardsToGoal() > 12) ? 'close' : S.phase === 'live' ? 'follow' : 'wide';\\n  if (shot !== V.shot) { V.shot = shot; const views = { kick: 'topdown', call: 'threequarter', close: 'threequarter', follow: 'threequarter', wide: 'threequarter' }; if (g.view && g.view.id !== views[shot]) g.setView(views[shot]); g.setZoom(shot === 'close' ? 1.35 : shot === 'kick' ? .7 : shot === 'wide' || shot === 'call' ? .8 : 1); V.shotLabel = { close: 'CLOSE-UP', kick: 'OVERHEAD', wide: 'WIDE', call: 'THE LINE', follow: 'FOLLOW' }[shot]; }\\n  const tx = h ? h.x : b ? b.x : S.los, ty = h ? h.y : b ? b.y : D.FYM;\\n  const spotX = S.phase === 'call' ? S.los : tx;\\n  g.focus(spotX, D.FYM + (ty - D.FYM) * .55, 16);   // (the camera eases to it: cam.smooth)\\n};\"),\n (\"  if (S.extras && S.extras.replaying()) E.font.title(g, 'REPLAY'\",\n  \"  if (V.shotLabel && S.phase !== 'idle') E.font.text(g, 'CAMERA: ' + V.shotLabel, 6, r.H - 26, '#8a90a8', { font: 'tiny', outline: '#000' });\\n  if (S.extras && S.extras.replaying()) E.font.title(g, 'REPLAY'\"),\n])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\ngrep -n \"view.id\\|\\.id ===\" vendor/my-3d2dge.js | head -3 | cut -c1-140","description":"Add mouse steering, victory dance and camera director"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":623,"cache_read_input_tokens":397910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":623},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91d88268-7ace-4e56-bce5-4455bcc4424c","uuid":"76b9a95f-eac7-4885-b581-275c9f5dc15a","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:01:32.379Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi66P3nBtj4JD7oHPjVQ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_017c6V8MYKc2VavU4oPYADkU":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-071627__xb697dc/work/AmericanFootballFiasco-AmericanFootball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-071627 && grep -n \"setView(\\|setZoom(\" vendor/my-3d2dge.js | head -4 | cut -c1-160 && python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(p,pairs):\n    s=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\n    for o,n in pairs:\n        c=s.count(o); assert c==1,(p,c,o[:90]); s=s.replace(o,n)\n    open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\n\n# 1. mouse steering for the human's player (the runner, or the defender), the lateral only from the keyboard or pad\nedit('src/30-sim.js',[\n (\"      if (I.pressed('pass') && off && h && S.passer !== h) { I.consume('pass'); S.lateral(h); }\",\n  \"      if (I.pressed('pass') && off && h && S.passer !== h && I.lastDevice !== 'mouse') { I.consume('pass'); S.lateral(h); }\"),\n (\"      const mv = I.move(); mx = mv[0]; my = mv[1];\",\n  \"      let mv = I.move();\\n      // the mouse steers: the player runs toward the point the pointer is on the field (when it is clear of the player)\\n      if (I.lastDevice === 'mouse' && FF.game.mouseGround) { const at = FF.game.mouseGround(); if (at && Math.hypot(at[0] - q.x, at[1] - q.y) > 10) { const m = Math.hypot(at[0] - q.x, at[1] - q.y); mv = [(at[0] - q.x) / m, (at[1] - q.y) / m]; } }\\n      mx = mv[0]; my = mv[1];\"),\n])\n\n// 2. the victory dance: the scoring side alternates two poses (a new animation, built from the engine's poses)\nedit('src/30-sim.js',[\n (\"  const sp = Math.hypot(q.vx, q.vy), cheer = S.phase === 'score' && q.side === S.tdSide;\\n  q.rig.update(dt, { x: q.x, y: q.y, z: 0, vx: q.vx, vy: q.vy, facing: q.f, run: clamp(sp / 110, 0, 1), down: q.down > 0 ? 1 : 0, pose: cheer && q.down <= 0 ? 'cheer' : null, expr: q.down > 0 ? 'wince' : cheer ? 'shout' : null });\",\n  \"  const sp = Math.hypot(q.vx, q.vy), cheer = S.phase === 'score' && q.side === S.tdSide;\\n  // the dance: the scorers alternate the cheer and the hips pose on the beat\\n  const beat = Math.floor(S.time * 2.2 + q.slot) % 2 ? 'hips' : 'cheer';\\n  q.rig.update(dt, { x: q.x, y: q.y, z: 0, vx: q.vx, vy: q.vy, facing: q.f, run: clamp(sp / 110, 0, 1), down: q.down > 0 ? 1 : 0, pose: cheer && q.down <= 0 ? beat : null, expr: q.down > 0 ? 'wince' : cheer ? 'shout' : null });\"),\n])\n\n// 3. the camera director: framing from the phase and the play (the wide kick view from overhead, the close carrier, the call's middle of the field)\nedit('src/40-view.js',[\n (\"V.focus = () => {\\n  const b = S.ball, h = b && b.holder;\\n  const tx = h ? h.x : b ? b.x : D.FYM, ty = h ? h.y : b ? b.y : D.FYM;\\n  FF.game.focus(tx, D.FYM + (ty - D.FYM) * .55, 16);   // (the camera eases to it: cam.smooth)\\n};\",\n  \"// the camera director: each moment has its shot. The call: the middle of the field; the snap and the run: the carrier, close;\\n// a kick: from overhead, wide; the whistle and the score: the spot, wide. A replay has its own three angles (35-extras).\\nV.shot = 'call';\\nV.focus = () => {\\n  const b = S.ball, h = b && b.holder, g = FF.game;\\n  const shot = S.phase === 'kick' ? 'kick' : S.phase === 'call' ? 'call' : (S.phase === 'live' && h && S.yardsToGoal() > 12) ? 'close' : S.phase === 'live' ? 'follow' : 'wide';\\n  if (shot !== V.shot) { V.shot = shot; const views = { kick: 'topdown', call: 'threequarter', close: 'threequarter', follow: 'threequarter', wide: 'threequarter' }; if (g.view && g.view.id !== views[shot]) g.setView(views[shot]); g.setZoom(shot === 'close' ? 1.35 : shot === 'kick' ? .7 : shot === 'wide' || shot === 'call' ? .8 : 1); V.shotLabel = { close: 'CLOSE-UP', kick: 'OVERHEAD', wide: 'WIDE', call: 'THE LINE', follow: 'FOLLOW' }[shot]; }\\n  const tx = h ? h.x : b ? b.x : S.los, ty = h ? h.y : b ? b.y : D.FYM;\\n  const spotX = S.phase === 'call' ? S.los : tx;\\n  g.focus(spotX, D.FYM + (ty - D.FYM) * .55, 16);   // (the camera eases to it: cam.smooth)\\n};\"),\n (\"  if (S.extras && S.extras.replaying()) E.font.title(g, 'REPLAY'\",\n  \"  if (V.shotLabel && S.phase !== 'idle') E.font.text(g, 'CAMERA: ' + V.shotLabel, 6, r.H - 26, '#8a90a8', { font: 'tiny', outline: '#000' });\\n  if (S.extras && S.extras.replaying()) E.font.title(g, 'REPLAY'\"),\n])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\ngrep -n \"view.id\\|\\.id ===\" vendor/my-3d2dge.js | head -3 | cut -c1-140","description":"Add mouse steering, victory dance and camera director"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_017c6V8MYKc2VavU4oPYADkU":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-071627__xb697dc/work/AmericanFootballFiasco-AmericanFootball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-071627"}}}
