{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi6ZgHrguUKnW3Jt1sM7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BtM4edBKxCy5ngNDMcDk9f","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"D=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-071627__xb697dc/work/AmericanFootballFiasco-AmericanFootball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-071627 && cd $D && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\na=json.load(open('about.json',encoding='utf-8'))\na['sourceInformation']['testing']=\"Headless Node tests (test/run.mjs: 53 checks over boot, the match, the attract mode, the Dev mode, the cup and its cutscenes, the features, the couch join, touch-only detection, and the flow through results and the reel), Playwright screenshots (tools/shots.mjs, tools/shots-screens.mjs), and the AI Hub harness's automatic check (tools/hub-check.mjs)\"\na['sourceInformation']['perspective']=\"Three-quarter camera from the sideline with a camera director that picks each moment's shot (the line, the follow, the close-up, the overhead kick, the wide whistle); replays from three angles\"\na['sourceInformation']['artDirection']=\"The engine's native look: HD Humanoid rigs drawn as pixel art at res ps1 (320x240, expanded to the window), procedural turf with painted end zones, stands with a crowd and swaying pennants, lights (LIGHTS OUT goes dark, with lamps on the players), a spinning ball, flying helmets, a referee and a mascot made from engine parts\"\na['sourceInformation']['animation']=\"The engine's Humanoid rig poses (run, down, cheer, hips, wince) driven from the match each step, a victory dance that alternates two poses on the beat, and the ball's spin; no motion-capture clips\"\na['sourceInformation']['audio']=\"All music, sound effects and voices written in code: a field song, a title theme, synthesized sound effects, and Animalese babble voices for the radio and the cutscenes\"\njson.dump(a,open('about.json','w',encoding='utf-8'),ensure